WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.160
Carole hears three households report missed visits. These are reports; attendance records remain unchecked.

2
00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:16.420
Missed visits are the event. Unwillingness is a guess. A poster is a solution. Separate the three.

3
00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:23.440
Carole identifies each source. Dates and each household’s barrier remain uncertain.

4
00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:31.780
The first resident clarifies: Tuesday, not Monday. Cancellation is uncertain. Carole attributes the correction.

5
00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:39.840
In triads, write event, source and gap. Ask, give feedback and retry without blame.

6
00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:49.660
Three households report missed visits. The first reports Tuesday. Records and each barrier remain unchecked. No cause is guessed.
